<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 4wk T-bill auction average yield 12.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech 4wk T-bill auction average yield 12.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield in a five billion crown auction of four-week Czech treasury bills hit 12.25 percent, the Czech National Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The minimum yield in the American style auction was 12.15 percent and the maximum yield was 12.35 percent. The offer of five billion crowns was oversubscribed with bids totalling 7.458 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom , 42-2-2423-0003</p>
